[{"description":"Ingresos de la compañía que opera y cómo se reparten. company null = la que opera; mode null = pagar. «240, paga» · «retiene 180» · «media paga 300» · «local 120, puerto 240».","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"company":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["PRR","NYC","CPR","B&O","C&O","Erie","NNH","B&M"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"mode":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["full","withhold","half"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"parts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"type":"integer"},"part":{"enum":["revenue"],"type":"string"}},"required":["part","amount"],"type":"object"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["company","parts","mode"],"type":"object"},"name":"runAndPayout","strict":true},{"description":"Una compañía compra un tren: al banco, del pool o a otra compañía (con precio acordado). «compra un tres» · «la Pennsy le compra el 4 a la B&O por 300» · «diésel entregando el cuatro».","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"company":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["PRR","NYC","CPR","B&O","C&O","Erie","NNH","B&M"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"from":{"enum":["bank","pool","company"],"type":"string"},"price":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"seller":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["PRR","NYC","CPR","B&O","C&O","Erie","NNH","B&M"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"tradeIn":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["2","3","4","5","6","D"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"trainType":{"enum":["2","3","4","5","6","D"],"type":"string"},"variant":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["2","3","4","5","6","D"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["company","trainType","variant","from","seller","price","tradeIn"],"type":"object"},"name":"buyTrain","strict":true},{"description":"La compañía paga un costo al banco (terreno, estación, ficha). «paga 120 de montaña» · «80 de estación».","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"type":"integer"},"company":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["PRR","NYC","CPR","B&O","C&O","Eri